      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，经历过Grand Live的赛马娘们，\n就连胜者舞台的伴舞练习也变得很积极。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b59a41e2bfe9f1e9a09506f99df58f68ff3341d5533c040429a42c56b0301b0",
