      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这时候，轻柔致意带了照片过来。\n明年的Grand Live，决定要使用成员们\n充满笑容唱歌的照片作宣传。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cefd23be2fed41a6792cb27f6348e0d4af340c9e956844de8150e5aa22083bf",
