      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "轻柔致意坚定地宣示，她希望将Grand Live\n这个能让赛马娘与粉丝相互传递情感的场所，\n继续传承下去──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d7ba0290912ded75ca1c741164e2162b374d205446f0d88c93241a55650bcb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
