      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰为了吸引人们的注意，\n而尽全力演唱到最后一首歌。\n轻柔致意也感觉到了成效。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a61c6a8522a290c23fdd8eace9ccd656d676d3c589aac50d07d0cd479adfef38",
