    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd477b9927b7a609f6c63f6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据说，演唱会里似乎有\n无声铃鹿在寻求的答案。\n无论如何，新的成员增加了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b3a3de4577b867ac5721970db9694185ed2bb4e7f24291044c7c5be7bf55ed",
