      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "演唱会结束后，醒目飞鹰注意到\n美浦波旁有来观看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d690a21b67f17e7d849bff236eb3179b350a159b551148ca98436944ef6826f1",
