      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成员们正在为Grand Live用的歌曲填词。\n为了和粉丝相互呼喊，\n加入打call和应答的提案因而浮现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b094d19953352bee7d59dfc0a61f36fc8607316124651611eed79fbb0307abcc",
